           <div class="work-head"><h3>Retopo Kit</h3><span class="cat cat-3d">3D</span></div>
           <p>A Blender add-on that takes a sculpt to a game-ready asset in one press. Blender&rsquo;s own Quadriflow Remesh gives you quads and then stops &mdash; no UVs, no baked normal map, no LODs, one object at a time, and it asks for a face count nobody can guess. Retopo Kit keeps that remesher as its engine and supplies everything around it: a quad size asked for in centimetres instead of faces, an automatic unwrap sized for the texture you are about to bake into, a normal bake whose ray distance is worked out from the model itself, LODs named the way Unreal expects, and a batch mode for a whole folder.</p>
