+# Flop Siege — palette
+
+Ten material colours sampled from the generated `key-art.png`. Use these as solid production swatches; the concept image itself contains small tonal variations.
+
+| Role | Colour name | Hex |
+|---|---|---|
+| Sky | Summer Blue | `#7FD0EE` |
+| Grass | Sunny Meadow | `#AFC64C` |
+| Cliff | Biscuit Bluff | `#D19258` |
+| Wood | Catapult Oak | `#C48A50` |
+| Wood shadow | Toasted Oak | `#89562F` |
+| Stone | Cloudstone | `#9CABB2` |
+| Stone shadow | Tower Slate | `#76848B` |
